1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,600
[Episode 23]

3
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,710
To answer every exam question correctly,

4
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,000
you either know all the answers
in advance

5
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:20,480
or

6
00:01:21,510 --> 00:01:22,920
eliminate every wrong one.

7
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,480
You have another story to tell?

8
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:26,480
I'm all ears.

9
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,950
You knew what Sun Jiahao wanted
from the very start

10
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:31,480
because

11
00:01:31,710 --> 00:01:34,400
only by carefully hiding yourself
from the beginning

12
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,840
could you leave no trace at all.

13
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:46,510
The way you police handle cases

14
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,310
is truly eye-opening.

15
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,120
No evidence

16
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:52,310
is itself evidence of a crime?

17
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:57,870
This plan began seven years ago.

18
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,590
At first,

19
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:02,310
you agreed to Sun Jiahao's request

20
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:06,430
and broke the rules by having
Han Shuang care for a pregnant woman.

21
00:02:08,590 --> 00:02:10,280
You never expected Xiao Ting to die.

22
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,240
To avoid being implicated,

23
00:02:17,030 --> 00:02:19,680
you had Chen Wenji abduct Han Shuang.

24
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,840
Then you saw the enormous profits
in illegal surrogacy

25
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,190
and helped Sun Jiahao establish Luoda.

26
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:29,120
You coerced Han Shuang
into working for you too.

27
00:02:30,430 --> 00:02:33,630
You can claim I did it for reputation

28
00:02:34,630 --> 00:02:35,710
or power.

29
00:02:37,910 --> 00:02:39,080
But money?

30
00:02:40,190 --> 00:02:41,310
With my status,

31
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:42,400
would I even care?

32
00:02:45,630 --> 00:02:46,590
Perhaps.

33
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,430
After all, deep down,

34
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,680
besides your brother Fan Zhicheng,

35
00:02:53,030 --> 00:02:54,240
another wound still haunts you.

36
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,240
You married into the Fan family,

37
00:02:57,910 --> 00:03:00,870
yet you went looking for a man
just for something to eat.

38
00:03:00,870 --> 00:03:02,680
But he's been dead for three years.

39
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:04,310
My life has been so hard, Fifth Uncle.

40
00:03:04,470 --> 00:03:07,430
Once you're part of the Fan family,
you die in the Fan family.

41
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:10,000
Stop!
Stop hitting her!

42
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,310
Fifth Uncle!

43
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:13,590
Fifth Uncle, please stop!

44
00:03:17,910 --> 00:03:18,910
Your mother

45
00:03:18,910 --> 00:03:20,470
had a very hard life,

46
00:03:21,470 --> 00:03:24,190
but endured it all in silence.

47
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:26,840
Until one day, she realized

48
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:28,710
her own son

49
00:03:28,910 --> 00:03:31,080
had become like everyone else
in the village.

50
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,310
He began to despise her.

51
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:37,630
So she chose to end her life.

52
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,240
On the surface,

53
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,190
it looks like a common family tragedy.

54
00:03:43,470 --> 00:03:46,710
But there is another truth.

55
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:06,400
She killed herself.
That's not my fault.

56
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:07,800
You could have saved her.

57
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,630
You merely thought

58
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:13,910
you'd live better after she died.

59
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,680
But you never considered

60
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,510
that without your mother,

61
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,720
your life would only become harder.

62
00:04:20,190 --> 00:04:21,240
I survived.

63
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:25,630
I got where I am, step by step,
through my own efforts.

64
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,720
I don't need protection.

65
00:04:26,830 --> 00:04:27,680
You do.

66
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:31,310
On one hand, you
wear a mask of virtue and save lives,

67
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:34,000
using your reputation
to protect yourself.

68
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:34,920
On the other,

69
00:04:35,510 --> 00:04:37,480
you run an illegal organization,

70
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,270
using money to protect yourself.

71
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:41,040
Everything you've done

72
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:43,190
stems from your fear
of returning to those

73
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,870
nightmarish days.

74
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:51,480
Captain.

75
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,120
We checked every related account.

76
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,630
All transactions were normal.

77
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:55,720
We found no problems.

78
00:05:09,270 --> 00:05:10,120
Then where is the money?

79
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:12,920
Where are the surrogacy profits?

80
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,120
You tell me.

81
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:32,310
Hello.
Officer He.
Hello.
Hello.

82
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:33,630
Thank you for making the trip.
This way.

83
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:34,560
All right.

84
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,870
These are villagers from our village.

85
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,070
Hello, everyone.

86
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:38,600
Come on.
Let's go.

87
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:40,680
Watch the steps.

88
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:44,160
Let's look up there.

89
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,000
Here.

90
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:07,310
Pavilions and towers.
Mm-hmm.
Mm-hmm.

91
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,720
Please.
Please.

92
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,270
I just took a look around.

93
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,750
Most homes in the village are new,

94
00:06:28,270 --> 00:06:29,630
and the roads have been repaired.

95
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:32,070
Sun Jiahao did a lot for this village.

96
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,600
I should say something,

97
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:38,040
though you may not like hearing it.

98
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:38,510
Go ahead.

99
00:06:39,510 --> 00:06:41,310
I'm not well educated.

100
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:44,310
I don't know where
Sun Jiahao's money came from,

101
00:06:44,830 --> 00:06:46,390
but I know the boy

102
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,000
never forgot his roots

103
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,630
and donated a lot to his hometown.

104
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,070
When we heard something
had happened to him,

105
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:55,270
we were truly heartbroken.

106
00:06:58,870 --> 00:07:02,510
I also heard
he wanted to reclaim his family roots

107
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,310
and change his surname back to Fan.

108
00:07:04,430 --> 00:07:05,240
That's right.

109
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:08,240
We had long planned
to restore him to the family,

110
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:10,190
but then this happened,

111
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,390
so we dropped the matter.

112
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,920
What do you know about his uncle,
Fan Zhichang?

113
00:07:17,190 --> 00:07:18,680
That heartless wretch.

114
00:07:19,070 --> 00:07:21,920
He hasn't returned
since he went to college.

115
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:27,270
I see.

116
00:07:27,270 --> 00:07:29,360
I'd like to see his old family home.

117
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,510
There's no rush.

118
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,120
Let's have tea first.

119
00:07:32,310 --> 00:07:33,160
Later,

120
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,630
I'll have two young men guide you.

121
00:07:35,830 --> 00:07:36,600
No need.
I know where it is.

122
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:48,870
Since my first two answers were wrong,

123
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:51,120
I still have a third.

124
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,720
You're playing games.

125
00:07:55,190 --> 00:07:56,720
You have no evidence of a crime

126
00:07:57,270 --> 00:07:58,680
and no motive.

127
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,270
What supports your guess?

128
00:08:01,870 --> 00:08:02,870
I keep wondering:

129
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:06,070
If my sister and Chen Wenji are alive,

130
00:08:06,510 --> 00:08:08,070
where would you hide them?

131
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:42,320
[Tablet of the Fan Matriarch]
[Tablet of the Fan Patriarch]

132
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:50,670
All right.

133
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:52,480
We'll be going now.

134
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,200
Officer He.

135
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:54,720
Stay for a meal before you leave.

136
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:56,750
No, thank you.

137
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:58,030
I still have things to do.

138
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:01,750
Therefore,

139
00:09:02,030 --> 00:09:04,120
the place where my sister
and Chen Wenji are hidden

140
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:07,670
must be entirely under your control

141
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:11,480
with sufficient medical facilities
and resources.

142
00:09:16,510 --> 00:09:17,320
I know

143
00:09:19,030 --> 00:09:21,270
the illicit money from Luoda
never entered your hands.

144
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:24,510
At your direction,
it was spent in Fanjia Village.

145
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:27,120
More precisely,

146
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:30,320
at a factory protected by the village.

147
00:09:34,670 --> 00:09:36,320
I have no idea what you're saying.

148
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,270
You don't need to understand.

149
00:09:39,630 --> 00:09:40,960
I have my answer.

150
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,320
Uncle Zhe.

151
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,480
The village chief says evacuate now.

152
00:09:51,750 --> 00:09:52,510
The police found us.

153
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,360
Take what's useful.
Ditch the rest.

154
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:55,750
Okay.

155
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,240
What about those girls?

156
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,670
Burn them all.

157
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,120
Go out through here.

158
00:10:23,910 --> 00:10:24,870
It will take you outside.

159
00:10:25,030 --> 00:10:25,630
Hurry!

160
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:28,720
What about you?

161
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,870
I can't keep running.

162
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:30,870
Don't run!

163
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:33,390
Hurry.
Find a way out and get help.

164
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,270
You must swim underwater
for five minutes to get out.

165
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:43,790
I've asked many people.
You're the only one who can do it.

166
00:10:53,670 --> 00:10:54,510
Officer He!

167
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,630
Officer He!

168
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:57,670
Why did you leave without a word?

169
00:10:57,870 --> 00:10:59,320
You must stay for dinner.

170
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:01,670
Everyone.

171
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,440
Attacking a police officer is illegal.

172
00:11:04,670 --> 00:11:05,870
Don't do anything rash.

173
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:09,870
Don't do anything rash.

174
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,440
Run!

175
00:11:20,670 --> 00:11:21,510
Are you okay?

176
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,270
I'm fine.

177
00:11:23,870 --> 00:11:24,360
Oh, right.

178
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,320
Han Ning's analysis was correct.

179
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,000
Fan Zhicheng's old family home

180
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,510
is cleaned and receives offerings daily.

181
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,480
And Luoda's donations to the village

182
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,080
were likely provided by Fan Zhichang.

183
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,790
Did you find the factory?

184
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,510
It should be nearby.

185
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,200
Everyone, split up and search.

186
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:44,910
Yes, Captain.

187
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:47,360
Move.

188
00:12:25,170 --> 00:12:27,230
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

189
00:12:27,230 --> 00:12:29,180
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

190
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:31,090
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

191
00:12:31,090 --> 00:12:32,890
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

192
00:12:32,890 --> 00:12:35,230
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

193
00:12:35,230 --> 00:12:37,660
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

194
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:42,710
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

195
00:12:42,710 --> 00:12:44,600
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

196
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:46,550
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

197
00:12:46,550 --> 00:12:48,670
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

198
00:12:48,710 --> 00:12:50,680
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

199
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:52,840
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

200
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:59,920
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

201
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:03,290
♪Why is that child crying?♪

202
00:13:03,520 --> 00:13:05,990
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

203
00:13:05,990 --> 00:13:07,610
♪Means I've grown up♪

204
00:13:07,610 --> 00:13:10,760
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

205
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:14,240
♪The wound still aches♪

206
00:13:14,650 --> 00:13:19,000
♪Like a biting winter♪

207
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:22,270
♪But a spark still glows♪

